   "text": "Massey University College - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nMassey University College\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nMassey University College (MUC) is your official pathway to a wide range of degrees at Massey University, one of New Zealand’s leading and most progressive universities. MUC courses are designed to improve your English language and academic skills and prepare you for a seamless transition to your degree at Massey University. From day one, MUC students have access to Massey University’s world-class facilities, services and social activities, while benefitting from small-class sizes and the personalised support of our highly qualified teachers.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n04/05/2026 06:09\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:30\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nYearly Fees\nMax: NZ$71,000.00\nMin: NZ$25,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n30%\n9,264 of 30,883 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1926\nCampus(es)\nAlbany, Auckland\nCountry\nNew Zealand\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n15/04/2026\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.massey.ac.nz/student-life/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.massey.ac.nz/study/scholarships-and-awards/?size=n_100_n\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JMKA_mR91y0\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
